        "created_at": "2016-05-28T13:34:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Only comics I’ve read are Watchmen, V for Vendetta, and Sandman, so I’m also not really a comics-reader.</p>\n<p>I’d definitely suggest Watchmen. If you’ve seen the movie first, though, it may lose some punch because the movie is almost a frame-by-frame remake of the comic. Yet, somehow, it’s not as good.</p>",
